                                                "sense_id": "9644a775-7340-34b4-b56b-6c27c4e75e06",
                                                "text": "At one sling\n Of thy victorious arm, well-pleasing Son."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a3066ea-26db-47b9-9f52-8054d8ad7d7d",
                                                "sense_id": "9644a775-7340-34b4-b56b-6c27c4e75e06",
                                                "text": "To be, or not to be, that is the question:\n Whether 'tis nobler in the mind to suffer\n The slings and arrows of outrageous fortune,\n Or to take arms against a sea of troubles,\n And by opposing, end them."
                                            }
                                        ]
